> Module Moods

```catala-metadata
declaration enumeration Colour:
  -- Red
  -- Green

declaration enumeration Mood:
  -- Red
  -- Blue

declaration structure Box:
  data x content integer
  data gone content integer

declaration scope Paint:
  input shade content Colour
  input box content Box
  output is_red content boolean
```

```catala
scope Paint:
  definition is_red equals
    match shade with pattern
    -- Colour.Red : true
    -- Colour.Green : false
```
